 "logline": "While Sadi's at work the pets throw a party in her flat, and every time the pet cam's red light says she's watching they freeze into innocent poses, each check more absurd, until the cat is caught dancing; she runs home and opens the door on the flat exactly as it was: the good boy under his halo in his bed, still in her red sequin jumpsuit; then the closet bursts open and the whole party spills out. (TikTok cut on the official sound: from the duet on the disc, through the pet cam checks, to the cover-up squeezed into its last bars.)",
